      ":question/problem": "The efficiency rating $E$ of a machine is modeled by the equation\n$E = R - \\frac{9}{25}(60 - L)$,\nwhere $R$ is the raw performance score and $L$ is the load level, with $L > 50$. Which of the following expresses $L$ in terms of $E$ and $R$?"
